    "title": "Roanoke looks to add more free parking downtown - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Colby Johnson ,\n8 hours ago ROANOKE, Va. (WDBJ) - The City of Roanoke is proposing a series of changes to downtown parking following the release of a year-long parking study earlier this week. Park Roanoke, which manages city-owned lots and spaces, is looking to increase free parking options in response to ongoing complaints from residents and visitors about limited availability and cost. Read full article\n2",
